title: The Hungarian Comrades
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_hungary_timer <= 0 and time >= 2 and time <= 20
on-arrival: c_hungary_timer = 5; month_actions += 1
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: international

= The Hungarian Comrades

[? if time <= 3 : In Budapest, Béla Kun's young Communist Party, founded by prisoners of war back from Russia, grows by the day. Count Károlyi's republic is too weak to govern. ?][? if time >= 4 and time <= 7 : Hungary is a Soviet Republic. In March the social democrats merged with Béla Kun's communists and took power without a shot. Romanian and Czech armies are closing in. ?][? if time >= 8 : The Hungarian Soviet Republic has fallen. Admiral Horthy's officers are hanging communists and Jews across the country, and the survivors have fled to Vienna and Berlin. ?]

- @solidarity: Call strikes for Soviet Hungary.
- @warn: Warn against the Hungarians' mistakes.
- @refugees: Take in the refugees.
- @easy_discard

@solidarity
subtitle: Demonstrations in every city. The police are ready for them.
view-if: time <= 7
on-arrival: militancy += 6; world_revolution += 4; repression += 4

Hands off Soviet Hungary: the slogan is chalked on every wall in Wedding and Neukölln.

@warn
subtitle: A revolution made by a merger at the top does not last. Moscow is irritated.
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence += 4;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -4);
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Luxemburg wrote as much of Russia. The Hungarians are not grateful for the reminder.

@refugees
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Some of them are brilliant, and some of them will want to run our party for us.
view-if: time >= 8
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.c_hungary_refugees = 1;
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 4;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 4;
RG.ecci('bukharin', 3);
!}

Hungarian comrades find beds in Berlin flats and jobs in the party's offices. They know how a red army was raised in a month, and they say so at every meeting.
